                <mxCell id="note" value="Errors:&lt;br/&gt;• 401 — JWT missing/invalid.&lt;br/&gt;• 404 — &lt;code&gt;{architecture}&lt;/code&gt; folder absent or no current.json under it.&lt;br/&gt;• 500 — manifest exists but fails Pydantic validation (schema drift).&lt;br/&gt;The flow chart definition itself lives in the frontend (frontend/src/data/modelFlows/&lt;arch&gt;.ts), not here — backend ships only the manifest." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#444444;" parent="1" vertex="1">
